flowchart LR
    accTitle: Minimum operational chain of a documented mechanism
    accDescr: The chain connects explicit state to an identifiable trigger, a control action, and a state transition. A possible learning consequence may change later behavior. The sequence is an analytical reading aid, not a mandatory software pipeline.

    S[Explicit state]
    T[Identifiable trigger]
    C[Control action]
    X[State transition]
    L[Possible later learning consequence]
    S --> T --> C --> X
    X -. may affect later behavior .-> L

    classDef state fill:#EAF4FB,stroke:#1A4A8A,color:#1C1C1E,stroke-width:1.4px;
    classDef control fill:#F4F4F4,stroke:#888888,color:#1C1C1E,stroke-width:1.2px;
    classDef learning fill:#EEF7EE,stroke:#27AE60,color:#1C1C1E,stroke-width:1.4px;
    class S,T,X state;
    class C control;
    class L learning;
